# Discord Agent Capabilities

`Lux.Integrations.Discord.AgentCapabilities` builds plan-only Discord operations for agents.
It covers server resources, conversations, roles, member interactions, and role-based behavior policy.

```elixir
alias Lux.Integrations.Discord.AgentCapabilities

AgentCapabilities.plan(%{
  guild_id: "123456789012345678",
  channel_id: "234567890123456789",
  member_id: "345678901234567890",
  role_id: "456789012345678901",
  agent_roles: ["moderator"]
})
```

The returned plans do not execute live Discord requests. A transport layer should review permissions,
inject a bot token, add audit reasons for moderation changes, and dispatch only the approved operations.
